{
  "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "拿一个立方体，用半径为 r 的球沿着它滚一遍，所有球扫过的地方合起来是个圆角立方体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.65,
      "size": 58464,
      "text": "这个圆角体有个名字，叫闵可夫斯基和，记作 K 加圈乘 r B。它就是所有到立方体距离不超过 r 的点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.75,
      "size": 44064,
      "text": "现在问：它的体积是多少？答案出人意料地整齐，是 r 的一个三次多项式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "fm-1",
      "filename": "formula-fm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/formula-fm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.47,
      "size": 55584,
      "text": "体积等于原体积，加表面积乘 r，加平均曲率积分乘 r 平方，再加三分之四圆周率乘 r 立方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "fm-2",
      "filename": "formula-fm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/formula-fm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.12,
      "size": 49968,
      "text": "这叫斯坦纳公式。四个系数都有几何含义，而它的证明就是把圆角体拆开数清楚。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "formula",
      "line_id": "fm-3",
      "filename": "formula-fm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/formula-fm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.54,
      "size": 40608,
      "text": "屏幕上四种颜色对应四项。请依次高亮，看每一项在图上是哪一块。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "pieces",
      "line_id": "pc-1",
      "filename": "pieces-pc-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/pieces-pc-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.83,
      "size": 61200,
      "text": "第一块是原来的立方体本身，贡献原体积。第二块是每个面往外推 r 的板，六块板合起来是表面积乘 r。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "pieces",
      "line_id": "pc-2",
      "filename": "pieces-pc-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/pieces-pc-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.47,
      "size": 55584,
      "text": "第三块是每条棱外面的柱面楔子，是圆柱的一瓣。所有楔子合起来是平均曲率积分乘 r 平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "pieces",
      "line_id": "pc-3",
      "filename": "pieces-pc-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/pieces-pc-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.76,
      "size": 60192,
      "text": "平均曲率积分等于二分之一乘所有棱长与外二面角的乘积之和。立方体每条棱的外二面角是九十度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "ball",
      "line_id": "bl-1",
      "filename": "ball-bl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/ball-bl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.63,
      "size": 42048,
      "text": "第四块最漂亮。每个顶点外面是一小片球面，八个顶点各贡献一片。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "ball",
      "line_id": "bl-2",
      "filename": "ball-bl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/ball-bl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.21,
      "size": 51408,
      "text": "这八片拼起来恰好是一整个球，所以第四项就是标准的球体积，三分之四圆周率 r 立方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "ball",
      "line_id": "bl-3",
      "filename": "ball-bl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/ball-bl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.25,
      "size": 67968,
      "text": "换成正四面体，只有四个顶点，每片更大；换成正八面体，六个顶点。请切换立体，看顶点项的读数完全不变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-1",
      "filename": "why-wy-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/why-wy-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.18,
      "size": 50832,
      "text": "原因是凸多面体所有顶点的外立体角之和恒为四倍圆周率，正好是一整个球的立体角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-2",
      "filename": "why-wy-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/why-wy-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.87,
      "size": 61920,
      "text": "注意这与上一讲的结论不冲突。那里说内立体角之和不是常数，立方体加起来是四倍圆周率只是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-3",
      "filename": "why-wy-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/why-wy-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "真正恒定的是外立体角之和，这才是高斯-博内定理在多面体上的样子。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "support",
      "line_id": "sp-1",
      "filename": "support-sp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/support-sp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.27,
      "size": 52272,
      "text": "还有个更简洁的看法。凸集的支持函数是在某个方向上能走多远，也就是内积的最大值。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "support",
      "line_id": "sp-2",
      "filename": "support-sp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/support-sp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.37,
      "size": 53856,
      "text": "闵可夫斯基和在支持函数下就变成加法。加上一个半径 r 的球，等于每个方向都往外推 r。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "support",
      "line_id": "sp-3",
      "filename": "support-sp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/support-sp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "size": 52848,
      "text": "屏幕上的读数验证了这点：x 方向的支持函数是一，加 r 之后正是圆角体在这个方向的边界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.8,
      "size": 44784,
      "text": "第一，闵可夫斯基和是用球擦一遍得到的圆角体，体积是 r 的三次多项式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.63,
      "size": 42048,
      "text": "第二，四项分别对应本体、面、棱、顶点，证明就是把它拆开数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "minkowski-steiner",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/minkowski-steiner/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "第三，顶点项恒为一整个球，因为外立体角之和恒为四倍圆周率。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
